# Type formers and free algebras

Independent constructor capabilities, free syntax for their combinations,
and structure-preserving inclusions between presentations.

`ProductTy`, `CoproductTy`, `UnitTy`, and `EmptyTy` each adjoin one constructor.
`SeqTy` adds products and unit; `SumTy` adds coproducts and empty; `FullTy` adds
all four. `Ty` is an equivalent concrete presentation of the full syntax.
